WEBVTT

00:02.507 --> 00:06.677
[Futaba sighs] You don't
really think it's 0%, right?

00:06.767 --> 00:07.767
What?

00:08.307 --> 00:10.687
[FUTABA] Come on, there has to
be at least some chance

00:10.767 --> 00:13.767
that Grid rescues Huroi
and clears B-408.

00:13.857 --> 00:16.687
Uh, maybe Morpheus miscalculated
and threw an error.

00:16.777 --> 00:19.317
[HINAKO] No, we haven't received
any error reports.

00:19.397 --> 00:23.077
Yeah, I know.
Just grasping at straws here.

00:23.157 --> 00:25.947
By sharing the quest,
Huroi changed everything.

00:26.037 --> 00:28.957
We can't count on Morpheus
to calculate the odds now.

00:29.707 --> 00:31.577
At this point, all we can do

00:31.667 --> 00:34.127
is hope that Grid manages
to pull this off.

00:34.707 --> 00:38.837
[FUTABA] He has a legendary job,
but he's still only level 21.

00:39.337 --> 00:41.177
This is a disaster.

00:42.047 --> 00:45.177
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:13.557 --> 02:16.437
[JUDGE] The item
of today's match is "daggers"!

02:16.517 --> 02:18.397
Whoever forges the finest dagger

02:18.477 --> 02:21.477
within three hours
shall be crowned victorious!

02:21.567 --> 02:23.737
[GRID] Pagma was
the legendary blacksmith,

02:23.817 --> 02:25.317
and I'm his successor.

02:25.407 --> 02:27.157
I refuse to lose.

02:29.447 --> 02:30.827
[EUPHEMINA] All right, noob.

02:30.907 --> 02:32.907
Let's see what you're
workin' with over there.

02:33.657 --> 02:35.787
Skill, Observe.

02:39.997 --> 02:42.757
[GAME VOICE] Your skill level
is too low to analyze.

02:42.837 --> 02:43.877
[EUPHEMINA] How?

02:43.967 --> 02:45.667
I've copied skills
from blacksmiths

02:45.757 --> 02:47.717
ranked way higher than him.

02:47.797 --> 02:51.677
Wait, could that mean
this guy's an epic class?

02:52.347 --> 02:54.267
No, that's impossible.

02:54.347 --> 02:56.847
There's only three epic class
holders in this game.

02:56.937 --> 02:58.767
Roy, Agnus, and me.

02:59.767 --> 03:00.897
Whatever.

03:01.187 --> 03:03.147
Guess I'll just have to
do this another way.

03:04.947 --> 03:06.147
[gasps]

03:07.737 --> 03:09.987
Ooh, girl. That is one hot ass.

03:10.067 --> 03:12.737
[JUDGE] Mr. Kahn, would you
kindly join us on-stage?

03:13.367 --> 03:15.367
By Miss Erina's request,

03:15.447 --> 03:17.077
the two of you
will now be competing

03:17.167 --> 03:19.127
as a master and apprentice team!

03:19.207 --> 03:20.577
-[GRID] What?
-[hushed chatter]

03:21.167 --> 03:22.247
[sighs]

03:22.337 --> 03:23.957
That's fine with me.

03:24.047 --> 03:25.587
-[MAN 1] Now it's two on one?
-[smirks]

03:25.667 --> 03:26.627
[MAN 2]
She asked for a handicap?

03:26.717 --> 03:27.877
[growls]

03:27.967 --> 03:29.927
You trying to say
I can't win, you fetus?

03:30.547 --> 03:32.757
[EUPHEMINA] He's gotta be better
than his apprentice, right?

03:34.517 --> 03:36.807
Hope you don't mind
if I borrow that skill.

03:38.727 --> 03:40.897
[GAME VOICE] Your Skill Copy
was successful.

03:40.977 --> 03:42.067
-[EUPHEMINA] Yes!
- Skill is now stored.

03:42.147 --> 03:44.437
[EUPHEMINA]
And now, it's hammer time.

03:47.027 --> 03:48.657
Oh yeah!

03:48.737 --> 03:49.987
This'll do nicely.

03:52.277 --> 03:55.247
[MALE FANS] Erina! Erina! Erina!

03:55.327 --> 03:56.997
[EUPHEMINA]
I got this in the bag!

03:57.077 --> 04:00.077
[GRID] I can feel the iron
transform with every blow.

04:00.167 --> 04:02.667
NPC Grandpa and I
are in perfect sync!

04:02.747 --> 04:04.497
Now we're cookin' with gas!

04:04.587 --> 04:05.667
Oh?

04:05.757 --> 04:10.677
♪

04:13.717 --> 04:15.057
[hisses]

04:28.487 --> 04:29.857
Mm.

04:44.537 --> 04:45.497
[KAHN] Hmm.

04:45.587 --> 04:47.457
What a fine piece of weaponry.

04:48.507 --> 04:51.507
It fills me with great pride
to craft beside you.

04:51.587 --> 04:53.387
That's good,
'cause we ain't done yet.

04:53.467 --> 04:56.427
♪

04:56.507 --> 04:57.927
Time for the big guns.

04:58.017 --> 04:59.767
I paid 10 gold
for this minotaur horn

04:59.847 --> 05:01.227
so I could win this quest!

05:01.307 --> 05:04.107
Oh, save me,
my perfect pricey princess!

05:10.317 --> 05:12.447
Yuss! Mama's done!

05:13.067 --> 05:15.777
[JUDGE] I can't believe my eyes!

05:15.867 --> 05:16.777
A dazzling blade,

05:17.117 --> 05:19.747
forged by an equally
dazzling craftswoman!

05:19.827 --> 05:22.537
[GRID] I hate to admit it,
but she killed it.

05:22.617 --> 05:23.917
That thing is awesome!

05:24.707 --> 05:27.627
[JUDGE] Now, can its power
rival its beauty?

05:33.217 --> 05:35.137
-[MAN 1] Whoa.
-[MAN 2] She forged an "Epic"!

05:35.217 --> 05:37.807
[MAN 3] And the stats
are remarkable too!

05:37.887 --> 05:39.557
[MAN 4] This match
is as good as over!

05:39.637 --> 05:43.017
-[VALMONT] Hmm.
-[MAN 5] Erina's incredible!

05:46.567 --> 05:48.067
-[giggles]
-[KAHN] My word.

05:48.147 --> 05:49.987
-She's as good as I am.
-Stop, I'm blushing!

05:50.067 --> 05:52.147
Quite impressive,
given she's so young.

05:52.897 --> 05:56.317
Regardless, the girl
is still no match for you.

05:56.987 --> 05:58.697
Isn't that right, Grid?

05:59.827 --> 06:01.997
[GRID] Duh.
Who do you think I am?

06:02.077 --> 06:03.867
[GAME VOICE] "Breath
of the Legendary Blacksmith"

06:03.957 --> 06:05.827
activated. Crafted item's
stats will increase.

06:05.917 --> 06:07.037
[GRID] Now...

06:08.247 --> 06:10.297
papa's done too.

06:10.377 --> 06:12.667
Crowd's gonna go nuts
when I whip this out!

06:14.177 --> 06:15.087
Mm?

06:15.177 --> 06:16.927
-[GUARD 1] Don't move!
-[gasps]

06:17.007 --> 06:18.307
[GUARD 2] Huroi confessed!

06:18.677 --> 06:21.557
He informed us that you are
a traitor to Earl Steim as well!

06:21.637 --> 06:22.597
[gasps]

06:22.677 --> 06:24.057
-[gasps]
-Hmm.

06:25.637 --> 06:26.727
[huffs]

06:27.647 --> 06:29.437
Huroi should be
far too exhausted

06:29.517 --> 06:31.227
to utter another word.

06:31.317 --> 06:33.987
The guards are acting
on someone's orders.

06:34.067 --> 06:36.157
You arranged all this
before the match began,

06:36.237 --> 06:37.317
didn't you?

06:37.407 --> 06:38.407
[scoffs]

06:38.817 --> 06:41.037
You know I've always
been a rather cautious fellow.

06:41.827 --> 06:44.957
I see. So you never trusted me
to deliver from the start.

06:45.037 --> 06:46.537
And what if I didn't?

06:46.627 --> 06:48.747
You're but a small rodent
in a cage.

06:48.827 --> 06:51.167
You wouldn't dare bite
the hand that feeds you.

06:51.667 --> 06:52.757
Right, Rabbit?

06:54.587 --> 06:56.087
Master Kahn!

06:56.177 --> 06:59.087
It appears that you'll have to
give up that forge of yours.

06:59.177 --> 07:00.927
Valmont, you damn cur!

07:01.007 --> 07:01.887
-You set us up!
-[GRID] Let me go,

07:01.967 --> 07:03.347
you walking quest dispensers!

07:03.427 --> 07:05.267
This is democracy manifest!

07:05.347 --> 07:06.477
What is the charge?

07:06.847 --> 07:09.437
Forging a dagger?!

07:14.647 --> 07:16.607
What a load of horse shit.

07:16.697 --> 07:18.737
What happens
to the item match quest now?

07:20.027 --> 07:21.447
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

07:21.527 --> 07:23.157
Your current quest has changed.

07:23.237 --> 07:25.327
-[Grid yells]
-[GAME VOICE] Your new quest is,

07:25.407 --> 07:27.747
"Apostle of Justice. S-Rank."

07:27.827 --> 07:30.457
This is a two-person quest
with Huroi.

07:30.537 --> 07:32.417
[GRID]
I've seen this reward before.

07:32.497 --> 07:33.837
Oh.

07:34.547 --> 07:36.217
It's exactly the same
as the one in the quest

07:36.297 --> 07:37.257
that Huroi showed me.

07:37.877 --> 07:39.677
Does that mean
there was another quest hidden

07:39.757 --> 07:41.507
in the Item Creation Match?

07:42.097 --> 07:44.007
Wait, I'm supposed
to break him out?!

07:44.097 --> 07:45.387
How do I do that
when I'm rotting

07:45.467 --> 07:46.727
in a freaking jail cell?

07:47.137 --> 07:49.597
And the penalty
is the "Coward" title?!

07:49.687 --> 07:51.227
Man, screw this shit. I'm out.

07:52.857 --> 07:54.687
Another undroppable quest?!

07:54.777 --> 07:56.987
God! Why does this
keep happening to me?!

07:59.067 --> 08:00.067
[gasps]

08:01.157 --> 08:02.907
In my years
with the Mero Company,

08:02.987 --> 08:06.197
I've seen quality items
from all across these lands.

08:07.247 --> 08:08.827
There's no one on the continent

08:08.907 --> 08:11.127
who can match
this craftsmanship.

08:12.037 --> 08:13.997
-We've been bested.
-[VALMONT] Nonsense.

08:14.707 --> 08:17.457
The crowd was convinced
that Erina claimed victory.

08:18.007 --> 08:19.467
Hide that thing, now.

08:20.217 --> 08:21.217
[EUPHEMINA] Hey.

08:21.637 --> 08:24.507
I did everything you guys
asked me to do. We won.

08:25.097 --> 08:26.927
You gonna give me
my reward now or what?

08:27.017 --> 08:28.267
Yes.

08:28.347 --> 08:30.807
Mero stands behind
every promise we make.

08:30.887 --> 08:32.647
-[fanfare playing]
-[GAME VOICE] Quest clear.

08:33.437 --> 08:34.937
A new title has been earned.

08:37.527 --> 08:40.067
If it weren't for your stunt,
I would've lost for sure.

08:40.147 --> 08:42.407
Perhaps the rumor is true.

08:42.487 --> 08:44.407
He may be Pagma's Successor.

08:45.577 --> 08:47.157
-Euphemina.
-Hmm?

08:47.787 --> 08:50.957
If I may,
I have a small proposal for you.

08:52.877 --> 08:55.457
[KAHN] Everyone,
do you have your weapons?

08:55.537 --> 08:56.497
[MEN] Yeah!

08:56.917 --> 08:59.087
We'll break Huroi and Grid
outta that dungeon.

08:59.167 --> 09:01.627
Then we'll make
the Mero Company rue the--

09:01.717 --> 09:03.217
-[door bangs]
-[ALL] Huh?

09:03.887 --> 09:06.507
I knew you insolent fools
were up to something.

09:07.137 --> 09:09.017
As is my right and my duty,

09:09.097 --> 09:12.097
I must arrest all
who rebel against their lord.

09:12.187 --> 09:13.607
You bastard.

09:13.687 --> 09:15.517
Have no fear, old man.

09:15.607 --> 09:18.027
I'll make sure
your forge is well cared for.

09:18.107 --> 09:22.487
-[laughing]
-Valmont, you pile of pig shit.

09:24.157 --> 09:26.987
[Huroi panting laboriously]

09:28.327 --> 09:31.497
Six more hours left.

09:32.537 --> 09:35.747
[groaning softly]

09:37.707 --> 09:39.167
[HINAKO]
Can't you see this is dangerous?

09:39.257 --> 09:41.717
We need to force him
to log out right now!

09:41.797 --> 09:44.637
If Huroi turns into a headline,
people will start to think

09:44.717 --> 09:46.467
the game is too dangerous
to play.

09:46.547 --> 09:48.717
I thought you said Grid
was supposed to rescue him,

09:48.807 --> 09:50.427
but he's locked in a cell.

09:50.517 --> 09:51.477
He's low-level.

09:51.977 --> 09:53.557
Should we really be putting
the fate of our company

09:53.637 --> 09:54.597
in this kid's hands?

09:55.017 --> 09:57.267
[HINAKO] Currently, the odds
of his rescue are...

09:57.357 --> 09:58.937
less than 1%.

09:59.727 --> 10:01.817
Grid certainly is low-level,

10:01.897 --> 10:04.697
but even so,
he's beaten all the odds before.

10:05.527 --> 10:06.657
And technically,

10:07.027 --> 10:09.987
the chance he'll unlock
a second job is not zero.

10:12.157 --> 10:13.117
There's hope.

10:13.707 --> 10:15.707
Let's bet
these final hours on him.

10:18.127 --> 10:20.547
[GAME VOICE] One hour remaining
until the quest expires.

10:20.627 --> 10:21.707
[Grid yells]

10:21.797 --> 10:23.797
Goddess of Luck,

10:23.877 --> 10:25.927
if you exist,

10:26.007 --> 10:28.507
I'm gonna punch you
over and over again,

10:28.597 --> 10:29.507
right in the tooth!

10:29.597 --> 10:31.347
[EUPHEMINA] Grid, are you there?

10:31.427 --> 10:33.427
Hey, Grid.

10:33.517 --> 10:34.767
-[GRID] It's the fetus!
-Grid!

10:34.847 --> 10:36.807
-What's she doing here?
-[EUPHEMINA] Yo, Grid!

10:36.897 --> 10:38.187
-Hello.
-[GRID] Oh, yuck!

10:38.267 --> 10:40.187
Is she my Goddess of Luck?

10:40.267 --> 10:41.727
Doesn't matter!
She's my only hope!

10:41.817 --> 10:43.027
[EUPHEMINA] Are you dead?

10:43.647 --> 10:44.777
[sighs]

10:44.857 --> 10:46.987
Come on! Where are you?

10:47.067 --> 10:48.487
I'm here to help you,
you douche.

10:48.577 --> 10:49.827
[rapid thudding]

10:49.907 --> 10:51.657
[muffled yelling]

10:51.737 --> 10:52.947
[screams]

10:53.037 --> 10:55.457
Not cool!
Don't scare me like that, dude!

10:55.537 --> 10:56.497
[muffled yelling]

10:58.327 --> 11:02.377
[scoffs] If you want my help,
I've got some terms for you.

11:02.457 --> 11:05.417
[muffled] Terms my ass!
Nah, terms deez nuts!

11:05.507 --> 11:07.387
[EUPHEMINA] Clearly,
you make epic gear.

11:07.467 --> 11:09.347
So, I want you to
make me an orb.

11:10.347 --> 11:12.217
[Grid grunts, gasps]

11:12.307 --> 11:14.477
Sweet freedom!

11:14.557 --> 11:15.847
Yep! Here you go.

11:16.347 --> 11:17.267
[GRID] Great!

11:17.347 --> 11:19.017
Thanks a lot, fetus.

11:19.107 --> 11:22.977
My name is "Euphemina,"
and it is totally adorable.

11:23.067 --> 11:24.897
So stop calling me "fetus."

11:24.987 --> 11:27.237
-Okay, Euphemina.
-Better!

11:29.867 --> 11:31.487
Did you really
break into a dungeon

11:31.577 --> 11:33.237
and save me just to get an orb?

11:33.327 --> 11:35.577
[giggles] You'll have to wait
for that answer

11:35.657 --> 11:36.907
until we get out of here.

11:36.997 --> 11:38.367
Never mind. I don't care.

11:38.827 --> 11:39.957
And you're a blacksmith.

11:40.037 --> 11:41.417
How the hell did you
get in here anyway?

11:41.497 --> 11:44.047
[laughs] First of all,
I'm not a blacksmith.

11:44.667 --> 11:47.417
I'm a Duplicator,
one of the epic classes.

11:47.507 --> 11:49.047
During our little match,

11:49.137 --> 11:52.177
I used my job and blammo,
duped your master's skills.

11:52.257 --> 11:54.137
Wait, you have an epic job?

11:54.217 --> 11:55.977
There's only three
that people know about, right?

11:56.057 --> 11:58.227
Yeah, but your job is rarer

11:58.307 --> 11:59.687
-than unique-class, isn't it?
-[gasps]

11:59.767 --> 12:00.807
Well, I...

12:00.897 --> 12:02.187
-[footsteps approaching]
-[BOTH] Uh?

12:02.807 --> 12:03.727
[GUARD] He's escaping!

12:03.817 --> 12:05.607
You won't get away!

12:05.687 --> 12:07.437
Damn. 'Course
we gotta fight right now

12:07.527 --> 12:08.697
with this shitty little dagger!

12:09.527 --> 12:11.197
[gasps] Unique?

12:12.407 --> 12:14.657
There are penalties,
but it's still frickin' sick!

12:14.737 --> 12:16.077
[GAME VOICE] System guidance.

12:16.157 --> 12:18.327
You have successfully
acquired a new skill.

12:19.077 --> 12:20.167
[Grid grunts]

12:22.087 --> 12:23.747
Parry this, dick!

12:24.207 --> 12:25.547
Blade Wind!

12:25.627 --> 12:26.547
[guards exclaim]

12:26.627 --> 12:29.217
Oh, wow. That was cool, Grid.

12:29.297 --> 12:30.677
Don't just stand there,
do something!

12:30.757 --> 12:33.097
-We need to save Huroi!
-Whoa, chill, bro.

12:33.177 --> 12:34.677
I don't really like
working for free.

12:34.757 --> 12:37.267
And I don't like bitchy
li'l babies! Frickin' help me!

12:38.637 --> 12:40.687
Is something stuck in your ears?

12:40.767 --> 12:43.307
I already told you
I'm not a baby!

12:43.397 --> 12:45.267
-Spear of Annihilation!
-[exclaims]

12:52.277 --> 12:53.697
God damn.

12:53.777 --> 12:55.367
[GUARD]
I found them! Down there!

12:55.447 --> 12:57.247
Man, I'm getting sick
of these guys.

12:57.327 --> 12:59.867
Uh? Hey! Grid,
where are you going?

12:59.957 --> 13:01.957
I'm looking for Huroi!

13:02.037 --> 13:03.957
-Tank those trash mobs, will ya?
-Wha...

13:04.537 --> 13:06.037
[GUARD] Seize the girl first!

13:06.127 --> 13:08.207
-Full assault!
-[growls in frustration]

13:08.297 --> 13:09.797
If I use too strong a skill,

13:09.877 --> 13:11.967
this whole place will turn
into a dust heap.

13:12.757 --> 13:15.007
I really wish I could
bust out flame magic,

13:15.097 --> 13:16.717
but it's not safe to use here.

13:19.887 --> 13:22.347
Grid, hurry up. Come on!

13:23.057 --> 13:25.267
[GAME VOICE]
Time remaining, five minutes.

13:25.357 --> 13:27.267
Damn it! I'm outta time!

13:28.647 --> 13:29.777
Over there!

13:30.567 --> 13:32.277
[grunts] Huroi!

13:33.157 --> 13:34.027
Uh?

13:35.407 --> 13:36.777
Wait, was that him?

13:36.867 --> 13:38.867
♪

13:40.657 --> 13:42.867
I am Winston's Knight and hero!

13:44.827 --> 13:45.837
Sir Leo!

13:46.917 --> 13:49.457
[GRID] If he's a knight, he's
gotta be at least level 180.

13:49.547 --> 13:51.047
And I'm only level 21!

13:51.127 --> 13:54.337
If you wish to rescue Huroi,
you'll have to go through me!

13:55.177 --> 13:57.677
[GAME VOICE] The Blacksmith's
Wrath has activated.

13:57.757 --> 13:58.967
Gotta buff my speed for you!

13:59.637 --> 14:00.977
[both grunting]

14:03.637 --> 14:05.017
[gasps, grunts]

14:05.097 --> 14:06.857
[yells]

14:07.807 --> 14:08.937
Blade Wind!

14:09.397 --> 14:10.397
[Leo grunts]

14:12.987 --> 14:14.317
You've chosen death.

14:14.947 --> 14:16.197
So be it!

14:18.947 --> 14:21.447
My flaming sword
shall engulf you!

14:21.537 --> 14:23.867
Not even your ashes will remain!

14:24.707 --> 14:26.827
Die, traitor!

14:26.917 --> 14:28.127
[gasps]

14:31.337 --> 14:32.797
Y-You weakling.

14:32.877 --> 14:35.337
'Tis but a flesh wound.

14:36.837 --> 14:38.927
[GAME VOICE] You have vanquished
the Knight of Winston.

14:39.677 --> 14:41.427
A new title has been earned.

14:41.517 --> 14:43.927
You have acquired
the item, Cell Key.

14:44.017 --> 14:47.017
[GRID] My tiny dagger
just owned that ass!

14:47.107 --> 14:48.857
[GAME VOICE] Experience earned.

14:49.607 --> 14:51.897
You are currently level 45.

14:53.277 --> 14:56.447
Hell yeah! [laughs triumphantly]

15:03.697 --> 15:05.037
[door unlocks]

15:09.127 --> 15:10.167
Oh, man,

15:10.707 --> 15:12.297
I was really excited to
kick your ass when I found you.

15:12.917 --> 15:15.877
But holy shit, you look like
a terminally ill raisin.

15:15.967 --> 15:18.177
Wait a second,
aren't you Kahn's...

15:19.797 --> 15:20.967
[GAME VOICE] Quest clear.

15:23.097 --> 15:24.137
Congratulations.

15:24.677 --> 15:26.937
You are the first player
in the history of Satisfy

15:27.017 --> 15:28.937
to unlock a second job.

15:29.647 --> 15:30.897
The deeds
you've accomplished today

15:30.977 --> 15:33.817
will be remembered
in this world for generations.

15:33.897 --> 15:37.857
This reward is even better
than I ever could have imagined.

15:38.607 --> 15:41.697
Nice!
I got the Apostle of Justice!

15:41.777 --> 15:42.777
[HUROI] Grid, my lord.

15:42.867 --> 15:43.867
Uh, your what?

15:44.947 --> 15:48.037
I, Huroi, bearer of
the blue wolf's blood,

15:48.117 --> 15:49.997
henceforth swear
to repay your good deed

15:50.077 --> 15:51.417
for the rest of my life!

15:52.957 --> 15:56.217
On my name as the partner
of the Apostle of Justice.

15:58.007 --> 15:59.507
Oh, cool.

16:04.757 --> 16:05.677
They did it.

16:06.177 --> 16:08.387
Those two actually did it.

16:08.477 --> 16:09.847
Yes, indeed.

16:09.937 --> 16:12.107
Now all that's left
is for them to escape.

16:13.937 --> 16:16.357
[panting]

16:17.317 --> 16:19.357
Crap,
I've only got one skill left,

16:19.987 --> 16:21.617
but it's too freaking powerful!

16:21.697 --> 16:23.117
[guard 1 grunts]

16:23.197 --> 16:25.117
I shall avenge my comrades!

16:25.197 --> 16:26.117
-[thuds]
-[yelps]

16:26.197 --> 16:27.407
[crashes]

16:27.497 --> 16:29.457
[GRID] Myeah!
Sorry 'bout that, dollface.

16:30.247 --> 16:32.247
Things got a little rocky, see?

16:32.337 --> 16:33.667
Hey, Grid!

16:33.747 --> 16:34.747
'Tis I!

16:34.837 --> 16:36.087
There's no need
to thank me, though.

16:36.167 --> 16:37.837
[EUPHEMINA]
Wasn't planning on it, freak!

16:37.917 --> 16:40.217
You are useless!
What took you so damn long?!

16:40.297 --> 16:42.137
[sighs] I shoulda stayed
in the dungeon.

16:43.507 --> 16:44.967
[guard 2 yelling]

16:45.057 --> 16:46.007
Uh, eff!

16:46.097 --> 16:47.267
[Huroi grunts]

16:48.057 --> 16:50.887
[groaning]

16:52.727 --> 16:53.897
[guard 2 grunts]

16:55.767 --> 16:57.107
-[panting]
-Damn, Huroi!

16:57.187 --> 16:59.107
That was nuts.
Are you okay, man?

16:59.187 --> 17:00.147
I'm fine.

17:00.777 --> 17:02.277
This is one of the skills
I got as a reward

17:02.367 --> 17:03.527
for clearing the quest.

17:06.117 --> 17:08.327
Both of you go on ahead
without me.

17:08.947 --> 17:10.867
I'll stall them
as long as I can.

17:11.407 --> 17:13.037
I made a pledge to you,

17:13.127 --> 17:15.627
and I intend to honor it,
no matter the cost.

17:15.707 --> 17:17.547
Okay, sounds good, bruh. Later!

17:17.627 --> 17:18.837
[EUPHEMINA] Wait for me!

17:18.917 --> 17:20.377
[GUARD 3]
Halt! Not another step!

17:20.467 --> 17:23.257
I command thee,
stop where you stand!

17:23.337 --> 17:25.547
-[guards groaning]
-[GUARD 4] I can't move!

17:25.637 --> 17:28.717
[HUROI] You scum are lower
than the filth beneath my feet.

17:29.347 --> 17:30.517
I'll carve you bastards up

17:30.597 --> 17:32.347
and feed every piece of you
to the pigs!

17:33.137 --> 17:35.267
But first,
you'll taste my new skill!

17:36.567 --> 17:37.527
[grunts]

17:37.607 --> 17:39.357
Unyielding Justice!

17:42.317 --> 17:43.697
Grid, my lord.

17:43.777 --> 17:45.567
Fare thee well!

17:45.657 --> 17:47.987
[panting]

17:49.117 --> 17:50.077
[gasps]

17:51.537 --> 17:52.497
[scoffs]

17:52.577 --> 17:54.287
You thought you'd get away?

17:54.377 --> 17:56.417
[gasps] Fetus, go!

17:56.497 --> 17:59.047
Hey, get off of me! Asshole!

17:59.127 --> 18:01.337
We're in an open area.

18:01.417 --> 18:02.587
I can take it from here.

18:04.467 --> 18:06.637
Demon King's Tail Fire!

18:06.717 --> 18:08.467
♪

18:11.637 --> 18:12.557
[grunts]

18:24.647 --> 18:26.197
[Grid whimpers]

18:29.537 --> 18:30.577
[chuckles]

18:30.657 --> 18:32.657
Aw, man, I so needed that.

18:33.117 --> 18:34.867
Damn, girl.

18:34.957 --> 18:37.417
Gone? With a single attack?

18:37.837 --> 18:38.707
-[RABBIT] Thank you.
-Hmm?

18:38.787 --> 18:40.247
[RABBIT] I'll take it from here.

18:41.707 --> 18:42.707
[VALMONT] Rabbit!

18:43.167 --> 18:45.087
Yes! My friend!

18:50.767 --> 18:53.557
Lord Valmont, I'm reporting you
to the authorities.

18:53.637 --> 18:54.847
-[gasps]
-Huh?

18:55.307 --> 18:57.057
You dare betray me?

18:57.147 --> 19:00.397
I have tolerated your methods
for long enough, my lord.

19:00.477 --> 19:02.187
[groans]

19:02.277 --> 19:05.987
Besides, I must go
wherever the profits lead.

19:06.067 --> 19:08.197
I am but a merchant, after all.

19:09.197 --> 19:11.697
So, wanna know why I saved you?

19:11.787 --> 19:14.407
'Cause a little rabbit
asked me to.

19:14.497 --> 19:16.917
Oh, that makes a lot more sense.

19:16.997 --> 19:18.457
[RABBIT] Oh, and Grid,

19:19.087 --> 19:21.797
I want you to know I'm betting
my entire hand on you.

19:21.877 --> 19:22.997
[GRID] Oh.

19:23.087 --> 19:25.377
There is no denying
your natural skill.

19:25.917 --> 19:27.717
But on your own,
it will be difficult

19:27.797 --> 19:29.967
to fully capitalize
on your potential.

19:30.047 --> 19:33.017
So, if you are willing
to join me in this venture,

19:33.637 --> 19:35.177
then my company
and I will offer you

19:35.267 --> 19:36.887
every chance to prosper.

19:37.847 --> 19:38.847
Wait, does that mean...

19:39.897 --> 19:42.397
[RABBIT] I promise
to make you a very rich man.

19:42.477 --> 19:44.727
[GRID] Oh.
Say that again, but slower.

19:44.817 --> 19:46.567
Hey, Grid.

19:46.647 --> 19:49.117
You better not forget
about the deal you and I made.

19:49.197 --> 19:50.777
You still owe me an orb.

19:50.867 --> 19:52.117
Don't worry. I got you.

19:52.197 --> 19:54.537
Hmm? Okay, that was easy.

19:54.617 --> 19:57.117
[GRID] And who's gonna
get me that orb recipe?

19:57.207 --> 19:59.787
You, fetus! Yes, you are.

19:59.877 --> 20:01.537
Well, see ya!

20:01.627 --> 20:04.917
[giggling]

20:04.997 --> 20:06.757
I'll make use of Kahn's Forge

20:06.837 --> 20:09.467
and start my new company
with that as my base.

20:09.547 --> 20:11.717
I will send for you
once all is in order.

20:11.797 --> 20:13.427
-Agreed?
-Yeah.

20:14.767 --> 20:15.717
Sounds good, man.

20:18.057 --> 20:20.267
[HINAKO] Thankfully,
Huroi appears to be healthy.

20:20.857 --> 20:22.647
But to err
on the side of caution,

20:22.727 --> 20:24.277
we've blocked his login.

20:24.357 --> 20:26.567
He basically has no choice
but to rest.

20:26.647 --> 20:29.107
We have witnessed
the birth of an era.

20:29.197 --> 20:31.817
Satisfy has its first user
with two jobs.

20:32.947 --> 20:34.987
Once again,
it seems our new friend Grid

20:35.077 --> 20:36.447
has managed to make history.

20:37.497 --> 20:40.667
And once again, it seems
he doesn't realize it himself.

20:41.417 --> 20:42.417
[slurping]

20:42.917 --> 20:44.207
[SATISFY NEWS HOST]
We interrupt with breaking news.

20:44.297 --> 20:46.417
An inside source claims
that for the first time

20:46.497 --> 20:50.127
in the history of Satisfy,
a player has acquired two jobs!

20:50.217 --> 20:51.137
In this economy?

20:51.217 --> 20:52.427
According to reports,

20:52.797 --> 20:55.427
there are numerous advantages
to possessing a second job,

20:55.507 --> 20:57.557
including an additional boost
to the player's stats

20:57.637 --> 20:58.847
every time they level up.

20:58.927 --> 21:00.767
Oh, cool.
So we're just cheating now.

21:00.847 --> 21:03.267
...focused most of their efforts
on obtaining rare jobs.

21:03.357 --> 21:04.817
But with this discovery,

21:04.897 --> 21:08.227
that focus is likely to shift
to pursuing a second job.

21:08.317 --> 21:11.947
This revelation could change
the future of Satisfy forever.

21:19.367 --> 21:21.577
I haven't gotten any DMs
from Huroi yet.

21:22.327 --> 21:24.787
Huh, it looks like my guy
hasn't even logged back in.

21:25.457 --> 21:27.667
Hah. None of my B, anyway.

21:28.297 --> 21:30.587
Thanks to Rabbit, your boy,
the Apostle of Justice,

21:30.667 --> 21:32.257
is about to be makin' bank!

21:32.337 --> 21:34.547
[GAME VOICE] Satisfy! Ready?

21:34.637 --> 21:35.597
Wait,

21:36.217 --> 21:37.807
Rabbit was arrested too?

21:38.427 --> 21:40.677
Yeah, he got a 10-year sentence.

21:40.767 --> 21:43.267
Earl Steim isn't
showing anyone mercy

21:43.347 --> 21:45.937
when it comes to Mero
and their misdeeds.

21:46.017 --> 21:47.817
Then,
what about the new company?

21:47.897 --> 21:49.317
Not happening, obviously.

21:49.397 --> 21:50.737
How am I gonna get rich?

21:50.817 --> 21:52.277
Sounds like you won't.

21:52.357 --> 21:54.657
[whimpering]

21:56.237 --> 21:57.407
Oh, by the way,

21:58.037 --> 22:01.577
Earl Steim has put a renewed
focus on running the village.

22:01.657 --> 22:04.827
He sent someone
eminently more qualified.

22:05.457 --> 22:08.127
None other
than his very own daughter.

22:10.047 --> 22:12.377
[♪ closing theme song playing]
